# Data (loaders fetch and verify; nothing raw is committed)
data/raw/
data/edgar/
data/xbrl/
data/build/
data/audit/
# Baseline runs: predictions, the pass-through raw bytes and the ledger. Evidence for
# the tables, too large and too numerous to commit; the report command publishes the
# summaries. The glob rather than one directory: a run written to data/baseline-pre/
# was committed by accident on 2026-09-20 because the rule named only data/baseline/.
data/baseline*/
# Training files: regenerated from a build in seconds by smallprint train dataset.
data/train/
# Fine-tuned runs, the same shape as the baselines and ignored for the same reason.
data/finetuned/
# The untuned bases and the laptop's edge point: run directories like the baselines, kept
# for the same reason; the report command publishes their summaries.
data/untuned/
data/edge/
# Load tests: raw timings and pass-through bytes, the evidence behind the serving tables.
data/bench/
# The gateway configuration with a served model added; regenerated by smallprint serve config.
boundary-served.yaml

# Models, adapters, checkpoints, quantised weights (published to Hugging Face, never here)
checkpoints/
adapters/
merged/
models/
quant/out/
